### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### DB Readiness Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Request – Support (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "11111111-1111-4111-a111-111111111111",
  "type": "technical_support",
  "requester_name": "Test User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "description": "No puedo acceder al sistema de notas desde ayer en la mañana",
  "priority": "high"
}

###

### Create Request – Platform Access (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "22222222-2222-4222-a222-222222222222",
  "type": "platform_access",
  "requester_name": "Test User Two",
  "email": "user2@example.com",
  "description": "Necesito acceso al módulo de reportes financieros",
  "priority": "medium"
}

